{% comment %}
  Piobox live overlay for Relaxed Tee. Render on the product template:
    {% render 'piobox-customizer-live', product: product %}

  The studio itself is hosted on Vercel, NOT in this theme's assets. Deploying it is
  `npm run deploy` in the Piobox repo — nothing to re-upload here.
  This snippet only supplies the product data and the cart wiring.
{% endcomment %}
{% if product.handle == 'relaxed-tee' %}
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://studio.blankd.co.za/piobox-customizer/customizer.css" />
<button type="button" class="button button--primary" data-piobox-open>Design yours</button>
<div id="piobox-studio-{{ product.id }}" data-piobox-host></div>
<script type="application/json" data-piobox-product>{{ product | json }}</script>
